# bro176_groupfault.rc — BRO-176 reap-stall regression test.
# crash_test groupfault forks a child that becomes a thread-group leader with
# 4 live sibling threads blocked in futex waits, then the leader #PFs. The
# parent waitpid()s the child. With the fatal-fault-group-fatal fix the child's
# group is torn down and reaped, so the parent prints:
#     BRO176-PARENT-REAPED-CHILD child=.. ret=.. status=..
# Without the fix the parent's waitpid() hangs forever (reap-stall) and that
# marker never appears.
run /boot/BIN/CRASH_TEST groupfault
